yout drawing and an honest indicative budget</li>\n      <li>Supply, installation, software and commissioning by one team</li>\n      <li>Dedicated support desk with contracted response times</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"whycard card elev-sm\">\n        <p class=\"mini\">Why buyers pick Bitsy</p>\n        <ul class=\"dots\">\n          <li>Free needs analysis against AVIXA standards</li>\n          <li>Layout, spec sheet and honest budget in 24 hours</li>\n          <li>Certified Technology Specialists, not a call centre</li>\n          <li>Turnkey delivery and in-house support desk</li>\n          <li>1000+ clients, 400+ locations pan-India, since 1994</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#quote\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Get my free AV design</a>\n        <div class=\"altact\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n      </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:64px\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"ctaband\">\n  <div><h2>Send us the room. We will send the design.</h2><p>Dimensions, viewing distance and what you want people to do in the space is enough for us to design and price it, free.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"acts\"><a class=\"btn btn-ink\" href=\"#quote\">Get my free AV design</a><a class=\"btn btn-cream\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">+91 99303 73731</a></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-right\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">What are Audio-Video Solutions?</h2>\n    <p>Audio-video solutions combine sound, display and control technologies into one system so a room communicates properly. The same discipline powers conference rooms, training centres, auditoriums, live events and experience zones. We design, supply, install and support the whole chain rather than dropping equipment on site.</p>\n    <h3>How audio-video integration works</h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Input devices</th><td>Microphones, cameras and media sources capture audio and visuals, forming the foundation of the system.</td></tr><tr><th>Signal processing</th><td>Processors and mixers refine those inputs, balancing sound levels and cleaning up video.</td></tr><tr><th>Output systems</th><td>Displays, projectors and loudspeakers present content with clear pictures and even sound for every seat.</td></tr><tr><th>Control interface</th><td>Touch panels and mobile apps switch sources, set volume and adjust lighting without training.</td></tr><tr><th>Connectivity</th><td>Every component is networked, wired or wireless, for real time control, monitoring and updates.</td></tr><tr><th>Integration and support</th><td>We commission the system as a whole and stand behind it with a dedicated support desk.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n    <h3>Key features that define an effective system</h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Seamless integration</th><td>Audio, video and control units behave as one coordinated network.</td></tr><tr><th>High quality output</th><td>Clear visuals and balanced sound even in large or acoustically difficult spaces.</td></tr><tr><th>Ease of use</th><td>Interfaces simple enough that any presenter can start a session unaided.</td></tr><tr><th>Scalability</th><td>The same design language grows from one huddle room to a multi room estate.</td></tr><tr><th>Standards based design</th><td>Needs analysis and coverage modelling against AVIXA standards.</td></tr><tr><th>Remote management</th><td>Monitoring and diagnostics that cut downtime and speed up support.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px;align-self:start\">\n    <p class=\"mini\">At a glance</p>\n    <ul class=\"dots\" style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><li>No external media player needed</li><li>Works with Android, Windows and pro control systems</li><li>Compatible with leading projector, mic, speaker and panel brands</li><li>Manage multiple rooms from one interface</li><li>Schedule and switch inputs across locations</li><li>Real time performance monitoring</li></ul>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#quote\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Get my free design</a>\n    <div class=\"altact\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Business case</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:34px\">Top benefits for your organisation</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Enhanced collaboration</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Meetings and presentations become interactive, connecting people across locations with clear audio and video.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Professional impact</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Good sound and clean visuals carry your brand through client meetings, launches and town halls.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Higher productivity</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">One touch control removes the ten minutes usually lost to setup at the start of a meeting.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Versatile application</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Boardrooms, classrooms, auditoriums and event venues, all on one design standard.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Lower lifetime cost</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Right sizing at design stage avoids the replacement cycle that cheap kit forces.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Types of audio-video solutions we deliver</h2>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Video conferencing systems</th><td>Cameras, microphones and speakers integrated for hybrid collaboration.</td></tr><tr><th>Projection and display systems</th><td>Laser projectors and LED or LCD screens sized to the room.</td></tr><tr><th>Sound reinforcement systems</th><td>Loudspeakers, amplifiers, DSP and mixers for consistent intelligibility.</td></tr><tr><th>Control and automation</th><td>Touch panels and controllers managing sound, visuals and lighting together.</td></tr><tr><th>Studio and live event setups</th><td>Broadcast quality packages for exhibitions, launches and streaming.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Why Bitsy is the preferred partner in India</h2>\n    <p>Bitsy has been an audio-video partner to Indian organisations for more than thirty years. Our work is to bring technology, design and usability together so a room simply works for the people using it.</p><p>Our team of Certified Technology Specialists and Certified Audio-Video Technologists tunes every installation for clarity, acoustics and reliability. Where other suppliers deliver hardware, we deliver consultation, system design, installation, integration, training and ongoing service through a support network that spans India.</p>\n    <p><a href=\"contact-us.php\">Reach out to our team</a> to plan your installation, or send the four field form on this page and a Certified Technology Specialist will come back within 24 working hours.</p>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">How industries use it</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">How audio-video systems are changing communication across Indian industries</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\" style=\"max-width:52em\">From corporate boardrooms and training centres to auditoriums, retail floors and hospitality venues, organisations across India use integrated AV to run real time collaboration, remote connectivity and immersive presentations. With hybrid work now the default, the quality of the room decides whether a meeting is productive or merely attended.</p>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-left\">\n  <div>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">FAQs about audio-video solutions</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">Answers to what buyers ask us most. Anything else, ask a specialist directly.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Call +91 99303 73731</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faqs\"><details><summary>What does a turnkey audio-video project include?</summary><p>Needs analysis, system design, equipment supply, cabling, installation, programming, commissioning, user training and a support contract. One team owns the whole scope.</p></details><details><summary>How long does an AV installation take?</summary><p>A single conference room is typically two to five days on site after delivery. Auditoriums and multi room rollouts are phased, and we give you the schedule with the design.</p></details><details><summary>Which conferencing platform do you support?</summary><p>Teams, Zoom, Google Meet and bring-your-own-device setups. We standardise on your platform so users see one consistent interface in every room.</p></details><details><summary>Do you handle acoustics as well as equipment?</summary><p>Yes. We measure the room and recommend the treatment needed, because most complaints about AV are acoustic problems rather than equipment problems.</p></details><details><summary>Can you upgrade our existing rooms instead of replacing them?</summary><p>Often yes. We audit what is installed, keep what still performs and quote only the gap.</p></details><details><summary>What support do you provide after handover?</summary><p>A dedicated support desk with logged tickets, remote diagnostics, defined response times and preventive maintenance visits written into the contract.</p></details></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Videos</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">See our audio-video work</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3 videogrid\">\n      <figure class=\"ytlite\" data-yt=\"XpvsSl-XG1c\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Play video: Bitsy audio-video solutions overview\">\n        <img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XpvsSl-XG1c/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"Bitsy audio-video solutions overview\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\">\n        <span class=\"ytplay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg></span>\n        <figcaption>Bitsy audio-video solutions overview</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"ytlite\" data-yt=\"1dxALclfJRA\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Play video: Bitsy AV installations showreel\">\n        <img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1dxALclfJRA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"Bitsy AV installations showreel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\">\n        <span class=\"ytplay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg></span>\n        <figcaption>Bitsy AV installations showreel</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"ytlite\" data-yt=\"B1e6Gu6MiBk\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Play video: Inside a Bitsy AV project\">\n        <img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi