ls stay with us. No spam, ever.</p>\n      <div class=\"altact\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"badges\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/gem.jpg\" alt=\"Certification\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/ISO.jpg\" alt=\"Certification\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/make-in-india.jpg\" alt=\"Certification\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-right\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">What we get right that others skip</h2>\n    <p>A standard room template is worth more than a premium codec. We define two or three room types for your estate, then repeat them, so users learn one interface and IT stocks one set of spares.</p><p>Microphone coverage, camera framing and echo cancellation are engineered for the actual table shape, not assumed from a datasheet.</p>\n    <h3>Decide these before you buy</h3>\n    <ul><li>Room count and room types</li><li>Platform standard: Teams, Zoom, Google Meet or BYOD</li><li>Table shape and microphone coverage</li><li>Camera framing and auto-tracking needs</li><li>Control interface and IT management</li></ul>\n    <h3>Where it is used</h3>\n    <ul><li>Enterprise boardrooms</li><li>Hybrid meeting rooms</li><li>Executive briefing centres</li><li>Interview and HR rooms</li><li>Training and certification rooms</li></ul>\n    <h3>What you get from Bitsy</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Free needs analysis and design by a Certified Technology Specialist</li>\n      <li>Spec sheet, layout drawing and an honest indicative budget</li>\n      <li>Supply, installation, software and commissioning by one team</li>\n      <li>Dedicated support desk with contracted response times</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"whycard card elev-sm\">\n        <p class=\"mini\">Why buyers pick Bitsy</p>\n        <ul class=\"dots\">\n          <li>Free needs analysis against AVIXA standards</li>\n          <li>Layout, spec sheet and honest budget in 24 hours</li>\n          <li>Certified Technology Specialists, not a call centre</li>\n          <li>Turnkey delivery and in-house support desk</li>\n          <li>1000+ clients, 400+ locations pan-India, since 1994</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#quote\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Get my free AV design</a>\n        <div class=\"altact\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n      </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:64px\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"ctaband\">\n  <div><h2>Send us the room. We will send the design.</h2><p>Dimensions, viewing distance and what you want people to do in the space is enough for us to design and price it, free.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"acts\"><a class=\"btn btn-ink\" href=\"#quote\">Get my free AV design</a><a class=\"btn btn-cream\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">+91 99303 73731</a></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-right\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">What are Conference Room AV Systems?</h2>\n    <p>Conference room AV is the combination of display, camera, microphone, audio processing and control that lets a meeting start in seconds and be heard clearly at both ends. Done properly it is standardised across the estate so users learn one interface and IT stocks one set of spares.</p>\n    <h3>How conference room AV works</h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Room typing</th><td>We define two or three room templates for your estate rather than designing every room from scratch.</td></tr><tr><th>Camera and framing</th><td>Camera choice and placement follow the table shape and seating so remote participants see faces, not profiles.</td></tr><tr><th>Microphone coverage</th><td>Table, ceiling or beam-forming arrays are chosen for coverage and reverberation, not for looks.</td></tr><tr><th>Audio processing</th><td>DSP handles echo cancellation, gain sharing and noise reduction so far-end audio stays clean.</td></tr><tr><th>Control and scheduling</th><td>One touch join, wireless presentation and room booking panels outside the door.</td></tr><tr><th>IT integration</th><td>Devices are on the network, monitored and updated from your existing management tools.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n    <h3>Key features that define an effective system</h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>One touch join</th><td>Meetings start from the calendar entry without a laptop hunt.</td></tr><tr><th>Wireless presentation</th><td>Any device shares content without dongles or driver installs.</td></tr><tr><th>Platform native</th><td>Certified for your standard, whether that is Teams, Zoom or Meet.</td></tr><tr><th>Consistent interface</th><td>The same panel and the same three buttons in every room.</td></tr><tr><th>Remote monitoring</th><td>Device health, firmware and usage visible to IT from one dashboard.</td></tr><tr><th>Room analytics</th><td>Occupancy and utilisation data that guides your next fit-out.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px;align-self:start\">\n    <p class=\"mini\">At a glance</p>\n    <ul class=\"dots\" style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><li>Standardised room templates</li><li>Certified for Teams, Zoom and Meet</li><li>Ceiling or table microphone options</li><li>Wireless content sharing</li><li>Booking panels and occupancy sensing</li><li>Remote management for IT</li></ul>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#quote\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Get my free design</a>\n    <div class=\"altact\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Business case</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:34px\">Top benefits for your organisation</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Meetings start on time</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">One touch join removes the first ten minutes usually lost to connecting.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Fewer support tickets</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">A single standard across rooms means fewer variations for IT to troubleshoot.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Better hybrid parity</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Remote participants hear and see as well as the people in the room.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Predictable rollout cost</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Room templates make budgeting and phasing straightforward.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Data for planning</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Utilisation reporting shows which room types you actually need more of.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Types of conference room av systems we deliver</h2>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Huddle rooms</th><td>Single bar device, one display, up to four people.</td></tr><tr><th>Standard meeting rooms</th><td>Bar or codec with wireless sharing and table mics for six to twelve people.</td></tr><tr><th>Boardrooms</th><td>Dual display, ceiling microphone array, DSP, control panel and camera tracking.</td></tr><tr><th>Training rooms</th><td>Multiple displays, presenter and audience microphones, lecture capture ready.</td></tr><tr><th>Executive briefing centres</th><td>LED wall, matrix switching and full room automation.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Why Bitsy is the preferred partner in India</h2>\n    <p>We have standardised meeting room estates for banks, universities, manufacturers and enterprises across India, which means we know what breaks in year two and design against it.</p><p>Certified Technology Specialists run the needs analysis, our engineers do the programming, and our support desk owns the room after handover. You get one number to call for the display, the audio and the control system.</p>\n    <p><a href=\"contact-us.php\">Reach out to our team</a> to plan your installation, or send the four field form on this page and a Certified Technology Specialist will come back within 24 working hours.</p>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">How industries use it</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Why hybrid work raised the bar for meeting rooms</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\" style=\"max-width:52em\">When half the participants are remote, a room that merely has a screen is a room that wastes everyone time. Enterprises, banks and campuses across India are re-standardising their meeting estates around intelligible audio, framed video and one touch control, because those three things decide whether hybrid meetings work.</p>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-left\">\n  <div>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">FAQs about conference room av systems</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">Answers to what buyers ask us most. Anything else, ask a specialist directly.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Call +91 99303 73731</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faqs\"><details><summary>How many rooms should we standardise?</summary><p>Two or three templates cover most estates: huddle, standard and boardroom. Training rooms and briefing centres are handled separately.</p></details><details><summary>Table microphones or ceiling microphones?</summary><p>Ceiling arrays keep tables clear and suit fixed layouts, table microphones cost less and suit rooms where furniture moves. We recommend based on the room measurement.</p></details><details><summary>Do you supply and integrate with our existing licences?</summary><p>Yes. We work with your Teams, Zoom or Meet tenancy and hand the devices over enrolled in your management console.</p></details><details><summary>Can a room be used both for Teams and for guest laptops?</summary><p>Yes. We configure native join for your standard plus a bring-your-own-device path with wireless or HDMI input.</p></details><details><summary>What does a typical mid-size room cost?</summary><p>It depends on display size, audio approach and control. Send the room details on this page and we will send an indicative budget within 24 working hours.</p></details><details><summary>Who trains our staff?</summary><p>We do, at handover, with a short session per room type plus a one page quick guide left in the room.</p></details></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">Installations from our project archive</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/1c473111-5ddc-4342-b0f8-588c0e2fe