/h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Requirement mapping</th><td>Bandwidth, PoE budgets, VLANs and multicast needs are derived from the AV design.</td></tr><tr><th>Cabling design</th><td>Cable standard, routes, containment and labelling planned with the interiors programme.</td></tr><tr><th>Active layer</th><td>Switches, PoE capacity and network segmentation specified and configured.</td></tr><tr><th>Racks and power</th><td>Rack layout, cooling, UPS and power distribution designed for the load.</td></tr><tr><th>Wireless</th><td>Wi-Fi coverage and density surveyed and designed for the real occupancy.</td></tr><tr><th>Documentation</th><td>As-built drawings, IP schedules and labelling handed to your IT team.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n    <h3>Key features that define an effective system</h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>AV ready network</th><td>Multicast, PoE and QoS configured for AV over IP.</td></tr><tr><th>Certified cabling</th><td>Tested and certified links with warranty.</td></tr><tr><th>Structured racks</th><td>Labelled, cooled and documented rack builds.</td></tr><tr><th>Resilient power</th><td>UPS, distribution and monitoring sized to the load.</td></tr><tr><th>Wi-Fi by survey</th><td>Coverage designed from a real site survey, not a floor plan guess.</td></tr><tr><th>Clean handover</th><td>Drawings, schedules and labelling your team can maintain.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px;align-self:start\">\n    <p class=\"mini\">At a glance</p>\n    <ul class=\"dots\" style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><li>Bandwidth, PoE and VLAN requirements</li><li>Cabling standard and routes</li><li>Rack layout, cooling and power backup</li><li>Wi-Fi coverage and density</li><li>Certified and tested links</li><li>Documentation and handover to IT</li></ul>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#quote\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Get my free design</a>\n    <div class=\"altact\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Business case</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:34px\">Top benefits for your organisation</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">AV that stays reliable</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">The network is designed for the traffic the rooms generate.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">One accountable vendor</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">No gap between the AV contractor and the network contractor.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Faster fault finding</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Labelled, documented infrastructure cuts diagnosis time.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Room to grow</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Capacity and containment planned for the next phase.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Cleaner audits</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Certified links and complete documentation.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Types of it infrastructure services we deliver</h2>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Office and campus fit-outs</th><td>Cabling, switching, racks and Wi-Fi for new premises.</td></tr><tr><th>Plant and warehouse networks</th><td>Industrial grade cabling and rugged wireless.</td></tr><tr><th>Retail chain rollouts</th><td>Standardised site kit deployed nationally.</td></tr><tr><th>Smart building integration</th><td>Building systems and AV on a managed network.</td></tr><tr><th>AV over IP deployments</th><td>Switching and configuration for networked AV.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Why Bitsy is the preferred partner in India</h2>\n    <p>We deliver the infrastructure and the AV together, so nobody discovers in week three that the PoE budget or the VLAN design cannot carry the rooms that were signed off.</p><p>Our team documents everything and hands it over to your IT department properly, then supports it under the same contract as the AV.</p>\n    <p><a href=\"contact-us.php\">Reach out to our team</a> to plan your installation, or send the four field form on this page and a Certified Technology Specialist will come back within 24 working hours.</p>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">How industries use it</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Why AV and IT can no longer be separate contracts</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\" style=\"max-width:52em\">Conferencing, signage, video walls and control rooms all ride the network now. Organisations that award AV and networking separately end up owning the integration risk themselves, which is why more Indian enterprises are buying both from one accountable team.</p>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-left\">\n  <div>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">FAQs about it infrastructure services</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">Answers to what buyers ask us most. Anything else, ask a specialist directly.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Call +91 99303 73731</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faqs\"><details><summary>Can you work with our existing network team?</summary><p>Yes, routinely. We design to their standards, hand over documentation and stay available for support.</p></details><details><summary>Do you certify the cabling?</summary><p>Yes, every link is tested and certified, with results and warranty documentation provided.</p></details><details><summary>Can you deliver AV over IP?</summary><p>Yes, including switch selection, multicast configuration and QoS for networked AV.</p></details><details><summary>Do you handle UPS and power?</summary><p>Yes, rack power distribution, UPS sizing and monitoring are part of the scope.</p></details><details><summary>Is Wi-Fi included?</summary><p>Where required, designed from a site survey rather than a floor plan estimate.</p></details><details><summary>Who owns support after handover?</summary><p>Our support desk, under the same contract and response times as the AV system.</p></details></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">Installations from our project archive</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/1c473111-5ddc-4342-b0f8-588c0e2fec81-1.jpg\" alt=\"infrastructure delivery installation 1\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/148bb996-a61b-4e29-b7b7-7cb89af02d51.jpg\" alt=\"infrastructure delivery installation 2\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2997b072-8760-498a-a02c-b77e07af4dc9.jpg\" alt=\"infrastructure delivery installation 3\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/80460de1-ba39-4c40-b582-c5c826f95d6d.jpg\" alt=\"infrastructure delivery installation 4\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"w