-in-india.jpg\" alt=\"Certification\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-right\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">What we get right that others skip</h2>\n    <p>The most common video wall mistake is buying a pixel pitch finer, and far costlier, than the viewing distance requires, or coarser, so content looks broken up close.</p><p>We calculate the wall from your content and your seating, then engineer structure, power, processing and service access around it.</p>\n    <h3>Decide these before you buy</h3>\n    <ul><li>Content that will be displayed</li><li>Number of inputs and outputs</li><li>Where the audience will stand or sit</li><li>Overall display size and aspect ratio</li><li>Structure, power and service access</li></ul>\n    <h3>Where it is used</h3>\n    <ul><li>Lobby and experience centre walls</li><li>Auditorium and stage backdrops</li><li>Command centre operator walls</li><li>Retail flagship storefronts</li><li>Event and conference stages</li></ul>\n    <h3>What you get from Bitsy</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Free needs analysis and design by a Certified Technology Specialist</li>\n      <li>Spec sheet, layout drawing and an honest indicative budget</li>\n      <li>Supply, installation, software and commissioning by one team</li>\n      <li>Dedicated support desk with contracted response times</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"whycard card elev-sm\">\n        <p class=\"mini\">Why buyers pick Bitsy</p>\n        <ul class=\"dots\">\n          <li>Free needs analysis against AVIXA standards</li>\n          <li>Layout, spec sheet and honest budget in 24 hours</li>\n          <li>Certified Technology Specialists, not a call centre</li>\n          <li>Turnkey delivery and in-house support desk</li>\n          <li>1000+ clients, 400+ locations pan-India, since 1994</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#quote\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Get my free AV design</a>\n        <div class=\"altact\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n      </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:64px\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"ctaband\">\n  <div><h2>Send us the room. We will send the design.</h2><p>Dimensions, viewing distance and what you want people to do in the space is enough for us to design and price it, free.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"acts\"><a class=\"btn btn-ink\" href=\"#quote\">Get my free AV design</a><a class=\"btn btn-cream\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">+91 99303 73731</a></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-right\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">What are LED and LCD Video Walls?</h2>\n    <p>A video wall is a single large canvas built from LED cabinets or bezel-thin LCD panels, driven by a processor that decides what appears where. Pixel pitch, viewing distance and content resolution have to be decided together, before anyone quotes a number.</p>\n    <h3>How video wall design works</h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Content and resolution</th><td>We start from the content you will actually show and the resolution it exists in.</td></tr><tr><th>Viewing distance</th><td>Pixel pitch is calculated from the closest viewer, so the image is neither pixelated nor needlessly expensive.</td></tr><tr><th>Wall geometry</th><td>Overall size and aspect ratio are set by sightlines and the architecture.</td></tr><tr><th>Processing</th><td>Inputs, outputs, window layouts and presets are specified with headroom for future sources.</td></tr><tr><th>Structure and power</th><td>Mounting, service access, power and cooling are engineered with your contractors.</td></tr><tr><th>Commissioning and service</th><td>Calibration, alignment, spare modules and a maintenance plan at handover.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n    <h3>Key features that define an effective system</h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Correct pixel pitch</th><td>Calculated, not guessed, from real viewing distances.</td></tr><tr><th>Seamless canvas</th><td>LED with no bezels, or LCD with sub-millimetre joins.</td></tr><tr><th>Calibrated uniformity</th><td>Brightness and colour matched cabinet to cabinet.</td></tr><tr><th>Flexible windowing</th><td>Multiple sources, sizes and presets on the same wall.</td></tr><tr><th>Serviceable design</th><td>Front or rear access planned before fabrication.</td></tr><tr><th>Redundancy options</th><td>Backup processing and power where downtime is unacceptable.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px;align-self:start\">\n    <p class=\"mini\">At a glance</p>\n    <ul class=\"dots\" style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><li>Content driven pixel pitch</li><li>Indoor and outdoor cabinets</li><li>LCD narrow bezel alternative</li><li>Processor and matrix included</li><li>Structure, power and cooling engineered</li><li>Spare modules and maintenance plan</li></ul>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#quote\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Get my free design</a>\n    <div class=\"altact\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Business case</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:34px\">Top benefits for your organisation</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Impact at scale</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">A single bright canvas that a room cannot ignore.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Right first time cost</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Pitch matched to distance avoids paying for pixels nobody can see.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Operational flexibility</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Any source, any layout, recalled from a preset.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Long service life</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">LED cabinets designed for continuous operation with serviceable modules.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Lower maintenance</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">No lamps, no filters, and module level replacement.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Types of led and lcd video walls we deliver</h2>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Lobby and experience walls</th><td>Brand and welcome content at architectural scale.</td></tr><tr><th>Auditorium and stage backdrops</th><td>Bright LED behind presenters, no washout.</td></tr><tr><th>Control room operator walls</th><td>Many sources, many windows, high uptime.</td></tr><tr><th>Retail flagship storefronts</th><td>High brightness LED facing the street.</td></tr><tr><th>Event and conference stages</th><td>Rental grade cabinets, fast build and strike.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Why Bitsy is the preferred partner in India</h2>\n    <p>Video walls fail on the details: structure, power, service access, processing headroom and calibration. We engineer all five, which is why our walls stay uniform years after commissioning.</p><p>As LED and LCD video wall integrators working across India, we handle design, supply, structure coordination, installation, calibration and service through one accountable team.</p>\n    <p><a href=\"contact-us.php\">Reach out to our team</a> to plan your installation, or send the four field form on this page and a Certified Technology Specialist will come back within 24 working hours.</p>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">How industries use it</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Where a video wall is the right answer</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\" style=\"max-width:52em\">Control rooms, lobbies, auditoriums, retail flagships and event stages all need one large, bright, seamless image. Command centres also need many sources on that image at once, which shifts the decision from panel to processor.</p>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-left\">\n  <div>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">FAQs about led and lcd video walls</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">Answers to what buyers ask us most. Anything else, ask a specialist directly.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Call +91 99303 73731</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faqs\"><details><summary>LED or LCD for our application?</summary><p>LED for seamless canvases, high brightness and unusual shapes. LCD for close viewing on a tight budget where thin bezels are acceptable.</p></details><details><summary>What pixel pitch do we need?</summary><p>Roughly, the closest viewing distance in metres indicates the pitch in millimetres. We calculate it properly against your content and seating.</p></details><details><summary>Can the wall show multiple sources at once?</summary><p>Yes, that is the processor job. We size inputs, outputs and window presets for how you will actually operate it.</p></details><details><summary>How is it serviced?</summary><p>Module level, from the front or rear depending on the design. We keep spares on site and cover response times in the contract.</p></details><details><summary>What about power and structure?</summary><p>Both are engineered as part of the design and coordinated with your electrical and civil contractors before fabrication.</p></details><details><summary>How long does installation take?</summary><p>A typical indoor wall is one to two weeks on site including structure, alignment and calibration, subject to site readiness.</p></details></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">Installations from our project archive</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/1c473111-5ddc-4342-b0f8-588c0e2fec81-1.jpg\" alt=\"video wall design installation 1\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/148bb996-a61b-4e29-b7b7-7cb89af02d51.jpg\" alt=\"video wall design installation 2\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2997b072-8760-498a-a02c-b77e07af4dc9.jpg\" alt=\"video wall design installation 3\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/80460de1-ba39-4c40-b582-c5c826f95d6d.jpg\" alt=\"video wall design installation 4\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/949786d1-480b-49a2-a994-78183ee8e620.jpg\" alt=\"video wall design installation 5\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/1696003b-7ea3-4cc5-9b71-ec183a3c4de4.jpg\" alt=\"video wall design installation 6\" loading=\