We calculate lumens for your room rather than the brochure room, and select the screen gain and gain angle to match the seating.</p>\n    <h3>Decide these before you buy</h3>\n    <ul><li>Ambient light control in the room</li><li>Image size, throw distance and lens</li><li>Lumens required for the seating plan</li><li>Screen type, gain and aspect ratio</li><li>Blending, mapping or single image</li></ul>\n    <h3>Where it is used</h3>\n    <ul><li>Auditoriums and lecture halls</li><li>Classrooms and labs</li><li>Simulation and training domes</li><li>Events and stage visuals</li><li>Architectural projection mapping</li></ul>\n    <h3>What you get from Bitsy</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Free needs analysis and design by a Certified Technology Specialist</li>\n      <li>Spec sheet, layout drawing and an honest indicative budget</li>\n      <li>Supply, installation, software and commissioning by one team</li>\n      <li>Dedicated support desk with contracted response times</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"whycard card elev-sm\">\n        <p class=\"mini\">Why buyers pick Bitsy</p>\n        <ul class=\"dots\">\n          <li>Free needs analysis against AVIXA standards</li>\n          <li>Layout, spec sheet and honest budget in 24 hours</li>\n          <li>Certified Technology Specialists, not a call centre</li>\n          <li>Turnkey delivery and in-house support desk</li>\n          <li>1000+ clients, 400+ locations pan-India, since 1994</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#quote\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Get my free AV design</a>\n        <div class=\"altact\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n      </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:64px\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"ctaband\">\n  <div><h2>Send us the room. We will send the design.</h2><p>Dimensions, viewing distance and what you want people to do in the space is enough for us to design and price it, free.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"acts\"><a class=\"btn btn-ink\" href=\"#quote\">Get my free AV design</a><a class=\"btn btn-cream\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">+91 99303 73731</a></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-right\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">What are Projection Solutions?</h2>\n    <p>Projection still wins where the image must be very large or the surface is not flat. Ambient light control and throw geometry decide whether it works, so lumens are calculated for your room rather than taken from a brochure.</p>\n    <h3>How projection design works</h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Room light audit</th><td>Ambient light and surface reflectance are measured before lumens are chosen.</td></tr><tr><th>Throw and lens</th><td>Image size, throw distance and lens selection are calculated for the space.</td></tr><tr><th>Projector class</th><td>Laser light source, brightness and resolution matched to the seating plan.</td></tr><tr><th>Screen selection</th><td>Screen type, gain and viewing angle chosen for the seating spread.</td></tr><tr><th>Blending or mapping</th><td>Multi projector blending or mapping where one image cannot cover the surface.</td></tr><tr><th>Commissioning</th><td>Alignment, colour matching and control integration on site.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n    <h3>Key features that define an effective system</h3>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Laser light source</th><td>Twenty thousand hours plus, no lamp changes.</td></tr><tr><th>Calculated brightness</th><td>Lumens matched to ambient light and image size.</td></tr><tr><th>Edge blending</th><td>Seamless very wide images from multiple projectors.</td></tr><tr><th>Projection mapping</th><td>Content shaped to architecture and irregular surfaces.</td></tr><tr><th>Screen matched</th><td>Gain and angle chosen for the seating spread.</td></tr><tr><th>Control integration</th><td>Power, input and shutter on the room control system.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px;align-self:start\">\n    <p class=\"mini\">At a glance</p>\n    <ul class=\"dots\" style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><li>Ambient light control</li><li>Image size, throw distance and lens</li><li>Lumens for the seating plan</li><li>Screen type, gain and aspect ratio</li><li>Blending, mapping or single image</li><li>Laser light source, no lamps</li></ul>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#quote\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Get my free design</a>\n    <div class=\"altact\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\">Call now</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/919821157155\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Business case</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:34px\">Top benefits for your organisation</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Very large images</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Scale that panels cannot reach economically.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Flexible surfaces</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Curved, irregular and architectural projection.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Low running cost</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">Laser sources remove lamp and filter cycles.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Discreet install</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">No visible hardware at the image surface.</p></div><div class=\"card elev-sm\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><h3 class=\"h3\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Simple operation</h3><p class=\"apps\" style=\"margin:0\">One button power and input on the room panel.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split\">\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Types of projection solutions we deliver</h2>\n    <table class=\"deftable\"><tbody><tr><th>Auditoriums and lecture halls</th><td>Large single image for presentation and film.</td></tr><tr><th>Classrooms and labs</th><td>Short throw projection with interactive options.</td></tr><tr><th>Simulation and domes</th><td>Blended multi projector environments.</td></tr><tr><th>Events and stage visuals</th><td>Rental grade high brightness projection.</td></tr><tr><th>Architectural mapping</th><td>Content shaped to buildings and sets.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"prose\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Why Bitsy is the preferred partner in India</h2>\n    <p>We calculate lumens, throw and screen gain for your actual room, which is why our projection installations do not look washed out on the day of the first event.</p><p>Design, supply, rigging, blending, control integration and service come from one team, with laser projector standardisation to remove lamp maintenance.</p>\n    <p><a href=\"contact-us.php\">Reach out to our team</a> to plan your installation, or send the four field form on this page and a Certified Technology Specialist will come back within 24 working hours.</p>\n  </div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">How industries use it</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">When projection beats LED</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\" style=\"max-width:52em\">Halls that need a very large image, rooms where the surface is curved or architectural, and venues where hardware must stay invisible: those are projection cases. Where the room is bright and used all day, LED usually wins, and we will say so before you spend.</p>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"split narrow-left\">\n  <div>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">FAQs about projection solutions</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">Answers to what buyers ask us most. Anything else, ask a specialist directly.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"tel:+919930373731\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Call +91 99303 73731</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faqs\"><details><summary>How many lumens do we need?</summary><p>It depends on image size and ambient light. A 200 seat hall with controlled light typically needs 7000 to 12000 lumens. We calculate it for your room.</p></details><details><summary>Laser or lamp projectors?</summary><p>Laser, in almost every case. Higher upfront cost, no lamp replacements, stable brightness and far lower total cost.</p></details><details><summary>Can projection work in a bright room?</summary><p>Only with light control or very high brightness. If neither is possible, we will recommend LED instead.</p></details><details><summary>What screen should we use?</summary><p>Gain and surface are chosen for the seating spread and ambient light. A high gain screen narrows the viewing angle, which is not always what you want.</p></details><details><summary>Do you do projection mapping?</summary><p>Yes, including content shaping, blending and playback systems for architectural and event work.</p></details><details><summary>What maintenance does it need?</summary><p>Filter cleaning where applicable, periodic alignment and colour matching, all schedulable under a support contract.</p></details></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">Installations from our project archive</h2>\n  <div cl