 feet. Larger sets and LED backdrops need more depth for lighting and camera distance.</p></details><details><summary>LED backdrop or green screen?</summary><p>LED gives realistic in-camera results with no keying, green screen costs less and allows any background in post. We match it to your workflow.</p></details><details><summary>Do we need a dedicated operator?</summary><p>No. We design for single operator use with presets, and train two or three people so the room is never blocked.</p></details><details><summary>Can you treat an existing meeting room?</summary><p>Often yes, if the dimensions and noise floor allow. We measure first and tell you honestly what the room can achieve.</p></details><details><summary>Do you support live streaming?</summary><p>Yes, including encoders, bonded connectivity where needed and platform setup.</p></details><details><summary>What about maintenance?</summary><p>Lamps, firmware, calibration and consumables are covered under a support contract with scheduled visits.</p></details></div>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p>\n  <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">Installations from our project archive</h2>\n  <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/1c473111-5ddc-4342-b0f8-588c0e2fec81-1.jpg\" alt=\"studio build installation 1\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/148bb996-a61b-4e29-b7b7-7cb89af02d51.jpg\" alt=\"studio build installation 2\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2997b072-8760-498a-a02c-b77e07af4dc9.jpg\" alt=\"studio build installation 3\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"washed\"><img src=\"https://www.bitsydisplays.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/80460de1-ba39-4c40-b582-c5c826f95d6d.jpg\" alt=\"studio build installatio